10
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:25,600
The degree to which certain personal animosities are actually defining how they're developing this really important technology is insane to me.

11
00:01:31,054 --> 00:01:31,600
Amazing.

12
00:01:31,790 --> 00:01:33,600
Great. Alright, let's do this.

13
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,320
Welcome.

14
00:01:35,438 --> 00:01:37,380
